  "abi": "i64_array_bytes_output",
  "description": "Compute one bounded Miller backward trial solution and normalize it by a supplied finite linear functional over F_998244353.",
  "source": {
    "title": "NIST Digital Library of Mathematical Functions, §3.6(iii), Miller's Algorithm and Eq. 3.6.5",
